  "frontier_coordinate": "R-136 separates current-root Doob centring from the R-125 future residual. Conditional centring contracts after deterministic or retained-measurable operators, but the literal deterministic-target-heat R-088 post-heat atom is already retained-field measurable and has zero future residual. A two-point no-go proves that its conditional mean cannot recover raw future variance. Keeping heat common while conditionally replicating only the legal future gives the exact replica variance and owner-half formulas, and the complete raw owner telescopes pathwise in each replica when the low endpoint and all later feedback are recomputed there. Forward Doob/OU transposition is reused from prior authority; the R-079 fixture retains an exact future-feedback correction three. Ambient product PSD is sufficient but not graph-necessary on an abstract tangent fixture, which redirects but does not close the proof. The production raw spatial intertwiner, once-owned q_k ledger, signed forest-current lower bound, positive finite-collar headroom, low and matching data, strict gap, absolute anchor, both A13 gates, OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, interacting measure, and Sector A remain open.",
